No diff. This run required no change to the harness.

The claim under test in arXiv:2609.30721 is a statement about a variance estimator
on binary paired outcomes and about exact binomial power, not a statement about a
training run. Nothing in karpathy/autoresearch or dustin-dev-35/autoresearch is on
the code path, so no experiment/<arxiv-id>-<series> branch was created and
harness_commit is null.

train.py in this directory is the complete, self-contained analysis. It depends only
on numpy and scipy.